Now we have operator and skill linked.

Now we can proceed with loading steps (R,S,T) which require operator linked and skill linked.

After verifying loading profile nominal, we have candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_alpha.

Now we need to establish clearance nominal (since origin_leg_loaded and destination_leg_loaded are false). Step U: establish_clearance_nominal shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha.

